      <title>US basketball player arrested with 75lb of marijuana at Nigerian airport, say authorities</title>
      <link>https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/nov/16/us-basketball-player-arrested-with-75lb-of-marijuana-at-nigerian-airport-say-authorities</link>
      <description>&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Suspect named as Greene Da’monte Khiree&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Drug smuggling carries life sentence in Nigeria&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;An American basketball player has been arrested in Nigeria for allegedly attempting to smuggle 33.95kg (75lb) of marijuana into the country.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nigeria’s National Drug Law Enforcement Agency (NDLEA) said a 28-year-old player named as Greene Da’monte Khiree from the state of Georgia was arrested at Lagos’s main airport last Wednesday after he arrived on a flight from Thailand via the United Arab Emirates.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/nov/16/us-basketball-player-arrested-with-75lb-of-marijuana-at-nigerian-airport-say-authorities"&gt;Continue reading...&lt;/a&gt;</description>
